 Problem definition: The opioid crisis has been called the worst drug crisis in American history. While myriad factors influencing this crisis have been examined, the questions of whether and how the diversion of prescription (Rx) opioids from legal supply chain channels to illegal marketplaces contributes to the ongoing crisis remain understudied.
